 "remarks": "Welcome to 63 Maple Tree Avenue Unit F, a Turn Key, beautifully adorned 2/3-bedroom, 1.5-bath End-unit townhouse in the desirable Maple Plaza West community. Offering convenience, privacy, comfort, versatility effortless entertaining.  The main level features hardwood flooring throughout. A bright and inviting open-concept layout that seamlessly connects the living and dining area.  Decorative wood trim design adding warmth and character, with sliding glass doors opening to a private outdoor deck. Versatile blinds that creates a seamless indoor-outdoor experience, perfect for morning coffee, outdoor dining, entertaining, or simply relaxing.  The thoughtfully designed kitchen features updated appliances, soft-close cabinetry, a double dishwasher, garbage disposal, cooktop, and exhaust hood, complemented by stone countertops and distinctive brick accents.   The home offers generously sized bedrooms and updated baths with contemporary touches. Recessed lighting is featured throughout the home.  The lower level includes a third bedroom and additional living space that can easily serve as a guest suite, home office, fitness studio, media room, recreation area, or in-law space. Separate Washer and dryer area.  Unit comes with one assigned parking space. HOA fee is $370 per mth. Covers grounds maintenance, trash removal, snow removal, water, sewer, and pest control. Conveniently located within walking distance of Metro-North's Glenbrook Station, with the bus stop just",
